e442c83a9c37f25c</id><updated>2026-11-07T14:57:25Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T20:55:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/tankers-carrying-russian-diesel-to-the-us-change-course/a-79870807--b4298bca46ea.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/tankers-carrying-russian-diesel-to-the-us-change-course/a-79870807?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Despite an ostensible deal between Donald Trump and Vladimir Putin to bring diesel to the US, tankers are reportedly unable to dock due to existing sanctions.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Stephen Miller named by Trump as new White House chief of staff</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2dbe395cd18d310e7c6aaef165e54df7caee96926e6645527cd0060754688c58</id><updated>2026-11-07T14:57:25Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T20:41:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/stephen-miller-named-by-trump-as-new-white-house-chief-of-staff/a-79881571--b75b041f5990.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/stephen-miller-named-by-trump-as-new-white-house-chief-of-staff/a-79881571?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The US president said he would be replacing Susie Wiles for the top advisory role. Stephen Miller is a controversial figure, known as a key architect of the administration's hard-line immigration policies.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ueno Bank scandal plunges Paraguay into political crisis</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:be7e93cd526d837185bdae6c8a5fdecf9890fe99a0ab30f4f703e01ce59e223b</id><updated>2026-11-07T14:57:25Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T20:23:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ueno-bank-scandal-plunges-paraguay-into-political-crisis/a-79881388--35a7e5f2572b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ueno-bank-scandal-plunges-paraguay-into-political-crisis/a-79881388?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Suspected financial fraud, public money at risk and millions of customers affected: Paraguay is in serious crisis following the sudden collapse of Ueno Bank. President Santiago Pena is facing impeachment.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Critics say Democrats should look into Trump's Middle East deals in future corruption investigations</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:52de94fd6b3f826221ceafaf7dc2bb06ca0453e7439a0586c496d683479ed34e</id><updated>2026-11-07T14:57:25Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T19:16:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/critics-say-democrats-should-look-into-trump-s-middle-east-deals-in-future-corruption-investigations/a-79877104--54038fc6b2c6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/critics-say-democrats-should-look-into-trump-s-middle-east-deals-in-future-corruption-investigations/a-79877104?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">After their victory in the US midterm elections, the Democrats have promised to investigate corruption in the Trump administration. Critics say the president's Middle East deals is an area they should focus on.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Ilse Aigner tipped by party allies as next German president</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4c5d7e967a87dbc91b5ef0a6e68ce26c8c409377d0565c203e1b9f704995b187</id><updated>2026-11-07T14:57:25Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T18:48:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ilse-aigner-tipped-by-party-allies-as-next-german-president/a-79880594--62497e57d523.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ilse-aigner-tipped-by-party-allies-as-next-german-president/a-79880594?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">German media reports suggest that Bavarian politician Ilse Aigner's chances of becoming the next president are on the up. Long favored by her Bavarian CSU, now it seems Christian Democrats nationwide plan to back her.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
